the academy of raya lucaria pretty much  if harry potter turned into a horror  film so many mysteries surround this  castle of sorcerers and when you take  your time to look around you start to  notice some reoccurring themes the first  thing you'll notice are cages  lots and lots of cages  some are big and some are smaller but  most of them are meant to cage a small  bird i can't tell what these birds are  meant for yet more than likely they're  messenger birds for the academy kind of  like the owls from harry potter but  could potentially be the giant birds  with the swords for talons that we see  at stormville castle maybe these birds  were stolen from the academy and used in  war for godric the golden but that's  just all speculation like most of these  lore videos will be please leave your  comments down below on what you think  all of these things could mean you  should also join our discord we're  always looking for more people to have  elden ring discussions with and would  love to have you in our community but  the academy is a strange place which is  a normal occurrence in the lands between  but when looking closer at the  environments of the academy it was  clearly a place for studying astrology  there are telescopes globes meteoric  crystal stones everywhere that the  people of this area seem to be  constantly studying and excavating the  giant elevators that we use on the  outskirts of the outdoor area of the  academy are likely used to dig giant  holes of dirt in order to find more of  these purple crystals some sorcerers  wear helmets with these purple crystals  these enemies are extremely rare in  comparison to the glimstone sorcerers  who we see much more often we can even  see a sorcerer's staff with the purple  crystal on the end of it these enemies  are stronger and pose much more of a  threat and these purple helmets or masks  are likely given to only those who have  really been at the academy for an  extremely long time and have mastered  many different spells making your way  further inside you'll notice these  glimstone masks of what i believe are  the former governors of the academy that  came before ranala who currently holds  the title of governor of the academy we  have some item descriptions that can  tell us who these former governors were  like alvinist conspectus the alvinous  glintstone crown description reads the  lineage of alvinous conspectus began  with the sorcerer lucette and its  adherents continue his study of meteors  which makes sense that there are many  examples of astrology throughout the  academy when a former governor founded  this study and its current governor  ranala is considered the queen of the  moon so there's obviously a huge  interest in why these sorcerers of the  lands between hold these crystals and  the study of astrology in general in  such high regard at the academy not that  anything looks clean or organized in the  lands between but the academy looks like  it's been in disarray books are thrown  around everywhere like there's a panic  to figure out something that has to do  with these crystals meteors and  astrology itself this is just my theory  but it likely has to do with ronnie the  daughter of ranala eg tells us that  ranny cannot continue her quest until  the stars above start to move again as  we all know at this point the stars are  controlled by general radon you can even  see in the item description of the spell  gravity well that the gravitational  technique was studied by the young radon  whose master was an albuster lord with  the skin of stone this tells us that  radon was a student of the academy or is  least a powerful sorcerer in his own  right and when you look at his moveset  that does start to make a lot of sense  he has the ability to control the stars  above which in ronnie's case stops her  from fulfilling her destiny it's likely  that ranala or possibly even ronnie  herself ordered the sorcerers of the  academy to start studying astrology so  that they too could control the stars  ranala is also obsessive towards her own  children so it would make sense that  she'd do this for her own daughter but  it does also seem that ronnie no longer  works or trusts her mother since she  decided to use us a tarnished of no  renown to kill radon for her so that the  stars can move again and she can  continue on her path however when we  first encounter ranala she doesn't seem  to be of right mind or  extremely obvious reasons we learned  from muriel at the church of vows that  ronald's heart was broken when ratagon  left her to marry marica  lord radigan was a great champion  possessed of flowing red locks  he came to these lands at the head of a  great golden host  when he met lady ranala in battle  he soon repented his territorial  aggressions there  and became husband to the carrion queen  however  when godfrey first elden lord was  hounded from the lands between  radigan left rinala to return to the  earth tree capital  becoming queen america's second husband  and king consort  taking the title  of second elden lord  the mystery endures to this day  as to why lord radicand would cast lady  ranala aside  and moreover  why a mere champion would be chosen for  the seat of eldon lord  you wish to know more of lady ranala  she is queen  head of the karyan royal family  and governor of the academy of real  lucaria  the great and beautiful full moon witch  sadly her heart was broken when lord  radican left her  and then when the academy rebelled  against the royals  she was locked away in the grand library  this makes a lot more sense when you  realize that there are no statues of  marca inside the academy with a broken  heart she likely resents queen marca for  taking ratagon away from her her state  of mind when we interact with her is  clearly unstable and maybe it's for good  reason we'll have to investigate her  side of the story much more there's a  hidden cave on the cliff side of the  academy that leads to a mine shaft of  creepy sorcerers and even more purple  crystals this man in a cage is also  quite interesting just one man in a cage  deep underneath the academy raises a lot  of questions for me what raises even  more questions is the boss fight you  find here as well two crystalline bosses  one with a spear and one with a staff my  katana didn't work on them whatsoever so  i decided to switch to a more blunt  weapon that seems to work against  crystal enemies the weapon i chose just  so happened to be radagon's hammer now i  don't know if these crystalline enemies  are weak to the golden order magic that  you get from weapons like this but it  definitely seemed like it the ash of war  on this hammer did a ton of damage and  staggered them every time i used it and  then i saw my summon use a katana that  did even more damage toward the end of  the fight so i have no idea what this  means at this point you receive the  crystal release spell upon defeating  this boss which reads this sorcery is  used by high ranking adepts among  crystallines some also call this sorcery  the crystal sun more astrology  references more astrological enemies and  as always i'm just getting more  questions i can't tell if this area down  here was built or found by the sorcerers  but if you continue through the doorway  you'll find a very long elevator that  takes you to an offset tower of the  academy at the top you'll find one chest  that carries the terra magica spell that  draws a sigil on the ground and gives  you a buff in magic damage when standing  inside of it there's no path to anywhere  else on this tower which again just  raises more questions for me why is  there just one random chest in this  random tower that i had to go underneath  the academy to get to it's almost as if  they were hiding it the academy of raya  lucaria is full of mystery and  environmental storytelling that honestly  raises more questions than answers i'd  love to hear what you all think down in  the comments and again join the discord  so we can have a conversation about all  things eldon ring you can also join my  twitch streams i stream all the time and  i'll be lore hunting and learning  everything i can about this incredible  game thank you all for watching i hope  you enjoyed it and i'll see you again  soon  you
 

